@Asisya.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5065
@adminToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_ADMIN
@userToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_USER

### Login admin (copia el token de la respuesta)
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@finanzauto.com.co",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login user (copia el token de la respuesta)
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@finanzauto.com.co",
  "password": "user123"
}

### Rutas del usuario autenticado
GET {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Crear categoria SERVIDORES (admin) -> 201
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Category
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SERVIDORES",
  "description": "Servidores fisicos y virtuales",
  "picture": "https://example.com/servidores.png"
}

### Crear categoria CLOUD (admin) -> 201
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Category
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CLOUD",
  "description": "Servicios en la nube",
  "picture": "https://example.com/cloud.png"
}

### Categoria duplicada -> 409
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Category
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SERVIDORES"
}

### Crear con token de user -> 403
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Category
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NO_DEBERIA_CREARSE"
}

### Crear sin token -> 401
POST {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SIN_TOKEN"
}

### Listar categorias -> 200
GET {{Asisya.Api_HostAddress}}/Category
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
